{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"拟紧对象, 拟分离对象"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"拟紧拟分离对象"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"中, 对象 $X$ 称为<strong>拟紧</strong>对象是指其任意覆盖存在有限子覆盖, 对象 $X$ 称为<strong>拟分离</strong>对象是指对任意拟紧对象 $Y,Z$ 以及态射 $Y\\to X$, $Z\\to X$, 有 $Y\\times_X Z$ 为拟紧对象.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n"}]}}